WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:22.640
[Upbeat music]

00:22.640 --> 00:25.080
[Jitin Prasada] It has to be human-centric.

00:25.080 --> 00:26.040
It has to be safe,

00:26.040 --> 00:29.760
especially for the cause that you have
taken up of children and women.

00:29.760 --> 00:48.660
[Upbeat music]

00:48.660 --> 00:50.090
[Jitin Prasada] And with that equal responsibility,

00:50.090 --> 00:52.820
we want you to partner shoulder to shoulder
with our government.

00:52.820 --> 00:59.660
[Music fades]
